      {
        "author_name": "Gregory Gouveia",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104758610190005816674/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU60GdqaYxF5KrQ0m3m7IV0JRSVQrSwYtbMtPVr8uprwDj8phXV=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "Great service at a very reasonable price. While opening my garage door last Tuesday Jan 27, the metal cord broke, so I had to close it manually. I called Vaudreuil doors and they came the very next day. I am very happy with the results of the repair and I would totally recommend Vaudreuil doors.\nKeep up the great work and a big thank you to Jason.",
        "time": 1769897680,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "High Pat",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107017530104063515286/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJrKbGijwG1M6gCOe-GTsssOgAU6cf_uw4Ut5JISBshlHvyVA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 weeks ago",
        "text": "The torsion spring on my garage door broke on saturday. Called and Dan answered right away. Super helpful, precise information. Was able to come within 24 hours. Did not expect such a quick service on the weekend. He followed up with a phone call. Job was done quickly and professionally. Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1768847206,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Martin Lacasse",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114844596270378422725/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV4vWPR-Bwkw13iSKynK6-eMe_wTky4VmUpB_gFnDqdzHGOlcwZhA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Excellent service! My garage door was misaligned, but Dan fixed it in no time. He was efficient, knowledgeable, and did a high-quality job. I’m very happy with the results and will definitely use them again.",
        "time": 1766160554,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Matt G",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116249435851104218592/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW6OhIuli7KE4qQJjQF9asJ8gED6x9IvNCFJb6yUomPVJql32Sw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Friendly, honest & efficient. 1st time using them. Highly recomend Dan & his team, a pleasure to deal with. They did not hesitate to remove shoes when going through our home and, tweaked things for inprovement and we have our garage back working better than before thanks to them! Thank you ⭐️!",
        "time": 1765995403,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Rosemary C",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113343337963077372073/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKAOsSWsudJj1vZRcW98e7GF03Rw7ikzhzWL7_7UyyMWJf_WA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
